OL,3,GNEWSAPatients' frustration at GP
OL,4,Asurgery's AI receptionist
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients have described their
OL,7,F"frustration" in dealing with a new AI
OL,8,Freceptionist tool at their GP surgery,
OL,9,Fwhich some said was a "wall" to
OL,10,Freceiving care.
OL,12,FNewbury Street Practice, in Wantage,
OL,13,FOxfordshire, began using the AI Andi
OL,14,Ftriage system in July, with all calls
OL,15,Fmade to the surgery passing through the
OL,16,Fbot.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the surgery said
OL,19,Fmajority of feedback regarding the new
OL,20,Fsystem had been positive, and that it
OL,21,Fwould "improve access" and "increase
OL,22,Fcapacity".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
