OL,3,GNEWSAPatients' frustration at GP
OL,4,Asurgery's AI receptionist
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut patient Jo Rogers is one of those
OL,7,Fwho have criticised the system and said
OL,8,Fthe AI bot "puts you off ever
OL,9,Fbothering" contacting the practice.
